cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TargetDesign-workbench"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit for motif-driven CRISPR guide design: motif patterns are defined
  first, candidate regions are extracted, exact, indexed, BLAST-based and
  model-based off-target searches are run, candidates are scored, filtered and
  ranked, and results are exported through a desktop workbench, a local web UI
  and command-line tools.
